          "_name": "form4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"form4\" group=\"Forms\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"formstyler, datepicker\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"bgColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#eae7dc\" selected>\n    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"usedRecaptcha\" value=\"false\"></mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row content-wrapper justify-content-center\">\n            <div mbr-form class=\"col-lg-4 offset-lg-1 mbr-form\">\n<!--Formbuilder Form-->\n<form action=\"koci.dietetyk@gmail.com\" name=\"Form Name\" method=\"POST\" class=\"mbr-form form-with-styler\" data-verified=\"koci.dietetyk@gmail.com\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div hidden=\"hidden\" data-form-alert class=\"alert alert-success col-12\">Dziękuję za przesłanie wiadomości!</div>\n<div hidden=\"hidden\" data-form-alert-danger class=\"alert alert-danger col-12\">Oops...! some problem!</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dragArea row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n<h1 mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"mbr-section-title mb-4\"><b>Kontakt</b></h1>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n<p mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\">Administratorem danych osobowych jest Oliwia Janusz, NIP:&nbsp;<br>5871744120, REGON:&nbsp;527385727. Dane wpisane w formularzu kontaktowym będą przetwarzane zgodnie z <a href=\"page1.html#content5-q\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">polityką prywatności</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<div data-for=\"name\" class=\"col-lg-12 col-md col-12 form-group mb-3\">\n<input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"Imię\" data-form-field=\"name\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"form-control\" value>\n</div>\n<div data-for=\"email\" class=\"col-lg-12 col-md col-12 form-group mb-3\">\n<input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" data-form-field=\"email\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"form-control\" value>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 form-group\" data-for=\"textarea\">\n<textarea name=\"textarea\" placeholder=\"Wiadomość\" data-form-field=\"textarea\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"form-control\"></textarea>\n</div>\n<div mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-mbrBtnAdd\" class=\"col-12 col-md-auto mbr-section-btn\"><a type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Wyślij</a></div>\n</div>\n</form><!--Formbuilder Form-->\n</div>\n            <div class=\"col-lg-6 offset-lg-1 col-12\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/pink-modern-facebook-profile-picture-1-1076x1076.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
